  m_Name: Q11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "Layer, Tag, v\xE0 Physics Layer Matrix d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m g\xEC?"
  choices:
  - text: "Layer d\xF9ng cho rendering (camera culling mask) v\xE0 physics (collision
      matrix). Tag d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 identify object nhanh b\u1EB1ng CompareTag.
      Physics Layer Matrix (Edit > Project Settings > Physics) \u0111\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a
      layer n\xE0o collide v\u1EDBi layer n\xE0o - critical \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1ED1i
      \u01B0u physics query v\xE0 tr\xE1nh self-collision.\r\n"
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "Ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t r\xF5 Layer vs Tag, bi\u1EBFt Physics Matrix."
  - text: "Layer \u0111\u1EC3 nh\xF3m object cho camera v\xE0 physics. Tag \u0111\u1EC3
      t\xECm ki\u1EBFm object b\u1EB1ng FindGameObjectWithTag."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "\u0110\xFAng nh\u01B0ng FindGameObjectWithTag r\u1EA5t ch\u1EADm,
      kh\xF4ng n\xEAn d\xF9ng."
  - text: "Tag d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 mark object v\xED d\u1EE5 'Player', 'Enemy'.
      Layer t\xF4i \xEDt d\xF9ng"
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Ch\u1EC9 bi\u1EBFt Tag c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n, kh\xF4ng hi\u1EC3u Layer
      importance."
  category: Unity
